  "notes": "Vendor figures from the DS-3E0510P-E datasheet (2024-03-08): **8 x gigabit PoE ports, 1 x gigabit RJ45 uplink, 1 x gigabit SFP**, 802.3af/at, **PoE power budget 110 W**, max power consumption 120 W (10 W idle). **110 W across eight ports is 13.75 W average** - three 30 W 802.3at devices fit, four do not. The **DS-3E0510P-E/M** is the 58 W build of the same chassis: 58 W belongs to that SKU, not to this one, and this entry carried it until 2026-11-20.",
